    "text": "The number of real roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>, is:",
